@startuml
participant "Ivory Left" as Left
participant "Obsidian Live" as Live
participant "Mint Right" as Right
Right -> Live ++ : reverse-direction activation
activate Live
note left of Live : left note spans the nested live segment
Live -> Left : reverse internal depth probe
deactivate Live
note right of Live : right note observes the remaining live segment
Live -->] : right boundary before final close
deactivate Live
== mirrored transition complete ==
[-> Left : final left boundary width control
Right --> Left : trailing internal control
@enduml
